\f0\fs24 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 Project Kebab \'97 Elliptical-Rail Apparatus\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2><$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Core conception\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 The elliptical-rail apparatus is a 
\f1\b Shakti Engineering design developed for Project Kebab from Johnny Stoat\'92s vague requirements and the accumulated test data from earlier, less stable apparatuses
\f2\b0 .\
Johnny claims intellectual ownership and presents the machine as evidence of his engineering genius. He did not design it.\
The design thinking belongs to the Shakti engineering team working off-page. Johnny contributes ambition, requirements, interference, escalating demands and a willingness to test things that more competent people would prefer to model first.\
The testing scenes should expose the gap between Johnny\'92s claims and his actual understanding. He knows enough vocabulary to talk about rotational speed, phase, spatial geometry, coherence and related parameters. He can demand changes and interpret favourable results as proof of his genius. Once discussion reaches why the apparatus behaves as it does, or how the engineering team has made multiple motions interact coherently, Johnny is out of his depth.\
The apparatus is sophisticated because Eloise\'92s engineers are very good at solving difficult problems.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Primary structure\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 The apparatus is built around a large 
\f1\b elliptical rail
\f2\b0  carrying independently moving disc assemblies.\
Each assembly begins with a carriage travelling around the rail.\
Mounted to each carriage is a 
\f1\b primary articulated extensible arm
\f2\b0 . The arm can:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 extend and retract;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 incline towards or away from the centre;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 vary the effective orbital radius of its disc;\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 raise or lower the disc relative to the other discs.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 At the end of the primary arm is another articulation supporting a 
\f1\b secondary arm
\f2\b0 .\
The secondary arm can rotate around the end of the primary arm, giving each disc an additional independent circular motion: effectively an 
\f1\b epicycle whose centre is itself travelling around the larger elliptical system
\f2\b0 .\
At the end of the secondary arm sits the final articulated disc harness.\
The exact articulation axes, gimbal ranges, drive systems, bearings, propulsion and control architecture remain unspecified unless a mechanical detail produces comedy, character conflict or necessary plot information.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Disc excitation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 Project Kebab does 
\f1\b not
\f2\b0  rotate a Gyges disc like a record on a turntable.\
The final harness spins the disc 
\f1\b end-over-end
\f2\b0 , as though it were a coin being continuously tossed without ever being released**.\
The spin axis passes approximately through a diameter of the disc rather than perpendicular to its faces.\
The faces therefore repeatedly change orientation as the disc flips through successive rotations.\
Each disc can participate simultaneously in several kinds of motion:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Main orbit
\f2\b0  \'97 its carriage moves around the elliptical rail.\

\f1\b Primary displacement
\f2\b0  \'97 the extensible arm changes radius, height and inclination.\

\f1\b Local orbit
\f2\b0  \'97 the secondary arm carries the disc around an epicycle whose centre is itself moving.\

\f1\b Harness orientation
\f2\b0  \'97 the final articulation changes the attitude of the disc.\

\f1\b Disc excitation
\f2\b0  \'97 the disc spins end-over-end like a perpetually tossed coin.\
In operation the apparatus can resemble a 
\f1\b mechanised model of a demented solar system
\f2\b0 : planets moving on eccentric paths while describing epicycles, changing orbital radius, climbing above and below each other and flipping continuously.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Geometry and motion are the machine\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 The apparatus is not best understood as a conventional machine containing several Gyges discs.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 The geometry and motion are the machine.
\f2\b0 \
The hardware exists to control relationships between excited Gyges fields.\
Experimental variables can include:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 individual disc rotational speed;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 relative rotational phase;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 carriage position;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 orbital velocity;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 arm extension;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 relative height;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 inclination;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 epicyclic speed;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 epicyclic phase;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 harness attitude;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 separation;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 relative angular relationships;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 overall spatial geometry;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 coherence between two or more fields;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 and related parameters discovered through testing.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 Project Kebab dialogue can range through 
\f1\b disc rotational speed, relative phase, spatial geometry, coherence and the like
\f2\b0  without requiring the narrator to explain every variable.\
Individual discs become substantially more consequential when their fields enter suitable relationships and begin behaving as one coherent system.\
The apparatus\'92s particular danger lies not merely in its ability to place the discs in unusual configurations, but in its ability to 
\f1\b drive them rapidly through changing configurations while maintaining coherence
\f2\b0 .\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 The rail plane\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 The normal plane of the elliptical track is not yet fixed in canon.\
It may begin horizontal, inclined or otherwise conventionally mounted.\
The whole rail may itself sit in an articulated cradle capable of changing the plane of the ellipse.\
That adds a global tuning variable independent of the individual disc assemblies.\
Tilting the apparatus might alter its relationship to:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 gravity;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 planetary orientation;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 magnetic or other environmental fields;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 a multi-universal reference condition discovered empirically during testing.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 The rail need not acquire this ability because Johnny requests it.\
Shakti Engineering may add it because the accumulated data indicate apparatus orientation matters.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Rubber Geometry\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 The pentagram objective does not require five discs to occupy a neat schoolbook star.\
In 
\f1\b rubber-sheet geometry
\f2\b0 , forms can be stretched and continuously deformed while retaining their relevant topological relationships.\
Project Kebab can exploit that idea directly.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 The pentagram need not be rigid.
\f2\b0 \
Five discs can preserve the underlying five-point relationship while:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 distances vary;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 angles change;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 vertices rise and fall;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 the structure stretches;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 it compresses;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 it skews;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 individual vertices describe epicycles;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 the arrangement becomes non-planar.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 The experimentally interesting object is therefore not one perfect pentagram.\
It is 
\f1\b the family of continuously deforming pentagrams
\f2\b0 .\
The machine can move among members of that family while phase, distance, height, inclination and coherence change continuously.\
\'93Rubber Geometry\'94 also provides comic territory:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'93Rubber Geometry.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 \'93It\'92s got nothing to do with the dimensions of your condoms.\'94\strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 \'93Or your\'97\'94\strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 \'93Johnny.\'94\strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 The concealed objective\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 At the point of 
\f1\b Testing the elliptical-rail apparatus
\f2\b0 , Johnny is publicly testing it as a 
\f1\b two-disc machine
\f2\b0 .\
He is concealing the five-disc pentagram objective.\
Sarah has obtained enough evidence from Rotherhithe to oppose increasing the number of Gyges discs.\
Johnny appears to comply.\
Shakti Engineering therefore delivers an improved two-disc apparatus.\
What is not advertised is that the architecture is modular.\
Additional carriage-and-arm assemblies can be mounted on the same rail.\
Johnny already has two discs and needs three more to satisfy the Sages\'92 objective.\
The two-disc test should establish the legitimate engineering virtues of the apparatus while its scalability remains hiding in plain sight.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 What the two-disc test can demonstrate\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 Without revealing the pentagram objective, the apparatus can demonstrate:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 stable control of two independently moving Gyges discs;\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 end-over-end excitation;\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 independently varied spin rates;\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 relative phase control;\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 moving separation;\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 changing relative height;\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 varying inclination;\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 epicyclic motion;\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 dynamic geometries;\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 maintenance of coherence while those geometries change;\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 cleaner behaviour than previous Project Kebab apparatuses.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 Johnny takes credit for the results.\
The machine periodically exposes that he does not understand the engineering that makes them possible.\
An engineer can answer a question Johnny was pretending to answer.\
Johnny can order one variable changed and discover that the control system has already compensated through three others.\
He can speak confidently about \'93the orbit\'94 when the engineers are managing a superposition of main orbit, epicycle, extension, inclination and disc rotation.\
Unexpected successful behaviour immediately becomes something Johnny claims he intended.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Five discs\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 Once Johnny obtains three additional discs, the modular apparatus can carry five assemblies.\
With five Gyges discs there are:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 10 pairs + 10 trios + 5 quartets + 1 quintet = 26 possible interacting groupings involving two or more discs.
\f2\b0 \
The Sages\'92 pentagram supplies the five-part relational structure.\
The apparatus makes that pentagram dynamic.\
Shakti Engineering\'92s control systems can potentially maintain coherence while multiple interacting groupings undergo rapid geometrical change.\
The important result is that 
\f1\b the five-disc configuration works
\f2\b0 .\
It does not immediately explode.\
It produces a cleaner and more stable result.\
It eventually produces 
\f1\b Missing Socks
\f2\b0 .\
That success rewards Johnny for violating the warning and teaches him the wrong lesson:\

\f1\b more discs + better control + stronger coherence = better communication.
\f2\b0 \
Chip fears coherence.\
Johnny regards coherence as evidence that he has solved the problem.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Quake-trance Box\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 The quake-trance Box belongs to an entirely independent design lineage.\
It is not an early Project Kebab machine and Project Kebab is not derived from it.\
The Box contains three Gyges-disc Platters driven by powerful motors.\
Those discs rotate substantially like records on turntables: their planes remain broadly fixed while they spin about axes perpendicular to their faces.\
Project Kebab instead flips its discs end-over-end while moving them through changing three-dimensional geometries.\
The connection between the systems lies in the physics revealed by their behaviour, not their engineering ancestry.\
During the Goa event, the Box accidentally brought three Gyges fields into an exceptionally coherent relationship.\
Relative phase, geometry, rotational conditions and coherence caused the three fields to behave as one system.\
The principal physical manifestation appeared at Rotherhithe.\
Fridge Force ultimately concluded that Goa and Rotherhithe had become 
\f1\b multidimensionally colocated
\f2\b0  for the relevant phenomenon.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Closed resonance\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 The classified Rotherhithe investigation contains the deeper warning.\
Immediately before the Goa configuration collapsed, instruments detected a resonance returning through the generating system.\
The return matched the source.\
It arrived 
\f1\b before the corresponding source signal had been generated
\f2\b0 .\
At the same moment the remote resonance locus ceased being remote and briefly coincided with the Goa apparatus.\
Fridge Force termed the condition 
\f1\b closed resonance
\f2\b0 .\
The Goa Box used fixed relative disc positions.\
It could pass through the condition only momentarily before coherence failed.\
The technical warning was that a system capable of 
\f1\b changing the relative geometry of its generating fields continuously while maintaining coherence might sustain the condition
\f2\b0 .\
That description later fits the elliptical-rail apparatus disturbingly well:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 multiple Gyges discs;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 independent phase control;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 end-over-end excitation;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 rapid main orbital movement;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 extensible articulated arms;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 independent epicyclic motion;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 variable relative height;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 variable inclination;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 continuously changing geometry;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 deliberate maintenance of coherence.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 Whether Shakti Engineering arrived at that architecture innocently, institutionally or deliberately remains unresolved.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Relationship to MoSES\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 Project Kebab and 
\f1\b MoSES
\f2\b0  exploit related principles but are 
\f1\b not equivalent in capability
\f2\b0 .\
Each MoSES drone carries a Gyges disc.\
A five-drone formation can reproduce many of the 
\f1\b geometrical relationships
\f2\b0  explored by Project Kebab:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 elliptical arrangements;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 changing radius;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 changing relative height;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 deformed pentagrams;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 phase relationships;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 controlled coherence;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 movement from one useful geometry to another.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 But drones cannot reproduce the full 
\f1\b kinematic regime
\f2\b0  of the Project Kebab apparatus.\
They cannot sustain the same:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 rapid elliptical orbital motion;\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 high-frequency individual epicycles;\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 tightly controlled compound motion;\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 rapid simultaneous changes of several geometric variables.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 Their inertia, propulsion and flight-control constraints make them less agile than disc assemblies driven mechanically around a laboratory apparatus.\
That limitation is also 
\f1\b deliberate and desirable from Fridge Force\'92s perspective
\f2\b0 .\
Fridge Force understands the danger of highly excited interacting Gyges systems.\
MoSES therefore uses controlled movement through a conservative operational envelope.\
Its drones reposition discs into useful geometries and transition between them, but do not deliberately reproduce the fastest compound motions that Project Kebab explores.\
Project Kebab asks:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 How far can moving coherent fields be pushed?
\f2\b0 \
MoSES asks:\

\f1\b How much useful field control can we obtain without pushing them that far?
\f2\b0 \
MoSES is more operationally mature but 
\f1\b less kinematically extreme
\f2\b0 .\
That difference is central.\
Fridge Force knows when not to move the discs faster.\
Project Kebab does not.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 MoSES visual correspondence\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 The visual relationship still matters.\
A MoSES pentad can momentarily occupy geometries recognisable from Project Kebab:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 a stretched five-point arrangement;\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 an ellipse;\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 varying relative heights;\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 a slowly deforming pentagram.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 The resemblance lets the reader recognise common field principles.\
But the motion should also feel different.\
Project Kebab can be frenetic, compound and almost mechanically manic.\
MoSES movement is deliberate, bounded and controlled.\
Five drones shift into position.\
The geometry changes.\
The field responds.\
Then they move again.\
The absence of high-speed epicyclic motion is not a deficiency in Fridge Force engineering.\
It is evidence of restraint.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Deprecated Project Kebab machinery\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 Older descriptions involving crude clamps, primitive spindle assemblies, improvised controls, cartoonish interfaces and other MacGyvered machinery are deprecated as descriptions of the elliptical-rail apparatus.\
They remain available as 
\f1\b earlier failed Project Kebab prototypes
\f2\b0 .\
This gives the apparatus a useful history:\
Johnny supplies bad ideas.\
Prototype machines fail or misbehave.\
Test data accumulate.\
Shakti Engineering extracts what matters and quietly produces something genuinely formidable.\
Dialogue associated with the old prototype drafts is not reliable canon.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

